---

The inverse DCT in src/nitrojpeg.c implements the algorithm of jidctint.c from
the Independent JPEG Group's libjpeg: this software is based in part on the
work of the Independent JPEG Group.

---

The draw.io reader in src/nitrodio.cpp follows mxGraph and draw.io
(https://github.com/jgraph/mxgraph, https://github.com/jgraph/drawio): the outlines of the
cloud, actor and document shapes, the default stylesheet, and the routing of the connectors
(ported from mxEdgeStyle, mxPerimeter and mxGraphView). Copyright (c) JGraph Ltd, licensed under
the Apache License, Version 2.0 (https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0).

---

The optional dependencies are not in this repository: scripts/get-deps.sh downloads them, and
the builds that use them link them in, under their own licenses:

- libjpeg-turbo: BSD-style / IJG / zlib
- Wuffs: Apache-2.0
- stb_image: public domain / MIT
- SDL3: zlib
- dav1d: BSD-2-Clause
- lunasvg and plutovg (our fork: https://github.com/gereoffy/lunasvg): MIT; plutovg's rasterizer
  is FreeType's smooth rasterizer, under the FreeType License: portions of this software are
  copyright (c) 2014 The FreeType Project (www.freetype.org), all rights reserved
- libcdr (our fork: https://github.com/gereoffy/libcdr): MPL-2.0
- libvisio (our fork: https://github.com/gereoffy/libvisio): MPL-2.0
- librevenge (our changes in patches/): MPL-2.0
- libxml2 (our configuration and changes in patches/): MIT
- lcms2: MIT
- zlib (the Windows and portable Linux builds; the others use the system's): zlib
- boost (headers only): Boost Software License
- mimalloc: MIT

---

